# CODEOWNERS — the human review floor, expressed as code.
#
# pack 02 §3: "R4 = human-only (paths marked R4 above plus `tests/redteam/**`,
# `tests/invariants/**`, `.github/**`)." pack 05, AGENTS.md HR-5 names the
# same set.
#
# These paths may only be changed by a human. The oracle-guard enforces the
# oracle subset in CI; CODEOWNERS enforces the rest by requiring an approval
# from the owner before the PR can merge.
#
# The owner is the single reviewer for R4. Replace @OWNER with the real
# handle before the first PR.

